+                    <strong>Non-destructive lifecycle controls</strong>
+                    <p>Suspension stops only the allowlisted runtime and pauses its enabled backup schedules. The database, runtime files, instance resources, modules, users, appearance, and encrypted backups remain untouched.</p>
+                </div>
